<section class="eg-section" id="workflows">
  <div class="eg-container">
    <div class="eg-section-head"><span class="eg-eyebrow">Three ways to put it to work</span><h2>Guided agents, beyond the chat window.</h2><p>The same application contracts fit a conversation, a document extraction, or a task reviewed before publication.</p></div>
    <div class="eg-workflow-row"><span class="eg-workflow-index">01</span><div><h3>Guide a conversation to a result.</h3><p>Collect details, handle corrections, apply business rules, and ask for a clear confirmation. QuoteGraph makes this concrete with an insurance quote.</p><a class="eg-link" href="/ezgraph/quote-graph/">Walk through QuoteGraph <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><div class="eg-flow" aria-label="Collect, rate, confirm"><strong>Collect</strong><span aria-hidden="true">→</span><strong>Rate</strong><span aria-hidden="true">→</span><strong>Confirm</strong></div></div>
    <div class="eg-workflow-row"><span class="eg-workflow-index">02</span><div><h3>Turn a document into structured data.</h3><p>Attach a receipt, constrain the capture schema, and return expense JSON. ExpenseGraph demonstrates a request that finishes without a dialogue.</p><a class="eg-link" href="/ezgraph/workflows/#extraction">Explore extraction <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><div class="eg-flow" aria-label="Attach, extract, validate"><strong>Attach</strong><span aria-hidden="true">→</span><strong>Extract</strong><span aria-hidden="true">→</span><strong>Validate</strong></div></div>
    <div class="eg-workflow-row"><span class="eg-workflow-index">03</span><div><h3>Review an answer before you publish it.</h3><p>Generate a draft, evaluate it through a typed judgment, and let code publish an accepted result or a fallback. DecisionHotelGraph shows a reviewed presentation.</p><a class="eg-link" href="/ezgraph/workflows/#reviewed-tasks">Explore reviewed tasks <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><div class="eg-flow" aria-label="Generate, judge, publish"><strong>Generate</strong><span aria-hidden="true">→</span><strong>Judge</strong><span aria-hidden="true">→</span><strong>Publish</strong></div></div>
  </div>
</section>
